# Play isolation — the Play ⇄ app fence

Play / Divecore is a **mini-app**. Once inside Play, Soft/Zen/Quest/Anime do not
apply — `src/play/neon-viper.ts` forces the Neon Viper tokens.

## Allowed Play paths (game)
`src/play/**` · `assets/play/**` · `src/play/data/**` · `scripts/check-heroes.ts` ·
`scripts/check-creeps.ts` · `scripts/check-towers.ts` · `scripts/play-art-prep.ts` ·
`src/play/generated-play-assets.ts` · Play docs (`games/grove/**`) · Play entries in
`PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`.

## Forbidden for Play work
`src/app/**` (except `src/app/play.tsx` — the Play shell mount only; no Soft/Zen
chrome or copy) · Soft/Zen/Quest/Anime screens · `src/app/copy/**` (except the
LF-only `library.md` fix). Play never restyles the app or adds app copy.

## Forbidden for App/Soft/Zen work
`src/play/**` · `assets/play/**` · `scripts/play-art-prep.ts` · the play check
scripts (`check-heroes` / `check-creeps` / `check-towers`). The app never edits
the game.

## AI rule (hard)
- A task labeled **app / Soft / Zen** MUST NOT stage Play files.
- A task labeled **Play** MUST NOT stage app files (except `src/app/play.tsx` and
  the one LF-only `library.md` fix).

`npm run check:play-isolation` (also part of `check:ota-gate`) fails any changeset
that mixes Play paths with non-Play app paths. The allowlist (never counted):
`src/app/play.tsx`, `src/app/copy/library.md`, `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`, `AGENTS.md`,
`CLAUDE.md`, `.cursor/**`, `.gitattributes`, `package.json`, `scripts/ota-gate.ts`,
`scripts/check-play-isolation.ts`, `docs/**`.

Note: `src/lib/dev-mode.ts` currently hosts BOTH `PRE_LAUNCH_DEV` (app) and
`PLAY_EVERYTHING_FREE` (Play). Any edit to it is a deliberate cross-domain change —
treat it as out-of-band, not a routine Play or app touch.
